# TechCo.Wiki harness

Read `AGENTS.md` before changing this repo. GEO is first: one citable record in HTML, Markdown, JSON-LD, and `/api/v1`.

The repository defaults to English. Only README files and the public website stay multilingual (`en`, `zh-CN`, `zh-Hant`). Agent, harness, Cursor-rule, and CI-facing docs stay English.

## Hard stops

- Do not invent funding, valuation, headcount, or tickers that are not already on the record.
- Ethnic Chinese identity explains inclusion only. Do not call NVIDIA, Yahoo, or Fremont-headquartered Pony.ai Chinese companies. Do not call TSMC / UMC / MediaTek mainland Chinese companies.
- Publisher wordmark is `TechCo.Wiki`. Canonical host is lowercase `techco.wiki`.
- Do not expand the catalog, add UGC, wire custom DNS, or submit IndexNow/Google/Bing unless the user asked.
- Demo `*.pages.dev` noindex is host-gated in `public/_worker.js` (`X-Robots-Tag` + `Disallow: /` robots.txt). Do not add a global noindex to shared HTML, and do not password-protect the demo.

## Acceptance (in order)

1. `npm run typecheck` and `npm test` — functions and source contracts (`tests/harness.test.ts` is file-based; do not import `catalog` for new harness asserts).
2. `npm run build && npm run harness` — built HTML in `dist/`.
3. `npm run e2e` (starts and stops its own preview) — click/type; screenshots are not enough. Language switch on `/search?q=TSM` must keep `?q=TSM`.
   `npm run e2e:pages` also exercises the local Pages runtime and true localized 404s. Missing Chrome must fail.
4. After deploy: `HARNESS_BASE=https://techcowiki.pages.dev npm run harness:host`.

`switchLocale()` being correct does not mean the static HTML has the query. Astro preview does not run `_worker.js`. Cloudflare `_redirects` cannot rewrite 404s; locale 404s are `public/_worker.js`.

## Links

- Clickable UI (toolbar, machine box, footer): same-origin (`markdownPath`, `/llms.txt`).
- Citations, sitemap, llms, API: absolute `https://techco.wiki` (`markdownUrl`).
- OpenAPI lives at `/api/v1/openapi.json`, not `/openapi.json`.

## Autolink

Protect `https?://…`, `中国大陆`, `Chinese mainland` / `mainland Chinese`, and hyphenated nationality (`United States-headquartered`) before matching.
